   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the retirement and social security law, in relation to an\noptional twenty-five year retirement plan for chief fire marshals, assistant\nchief fire marshals, fire marshals II, and fire marshals I in Suffolk county",
    "basePrintNo": "S5754",
